0 Linger — one-motor six-bar approximate dwell machine
0 Name: linger.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 !LICENSE Redistributable under the BSD-3-Clause license; see ../licenses/linger.txt.
0 // Original native arrangement. One fixed motor on hub port A.
0 // Continuous input produces an approximate quarter-turn dwell in the orange output.
0 // Five moving links, seven ordinary hinges, retained physical shafts and no imposed output path.
0 // The near dwell includes a small reversal and is not an output lock.
0 // External standard part meshes are referenced, not embedded.
